      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "51",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwalondaŋa kuloŋa, mwakeŋa akeŋaŋa Yehova, ntiyililenu, talenu kwilola kwayibalwiluwu, nikuwina wamwikela mwayipundiluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu kudi nkakulula yenu Abarahama, nikudi Sara wayivweli. Muloŋa heliliyi wuchidi muntu wumu hohu namutambikili, namukiswililinkisu, namuvulishili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nakundeji dehi Ziyona, nakundejidehi mahembindi ejima, isaŋa dindi, dadiŋi damukunkulwayi, nadi balumuni dehi neyi Edeni, niikuna dindi dakadi meji nadibalumuni dehi neyi itempada Yehova; mwakamwekana nikuzaŋa ajala, nikutiya kuwaha, nikusakilila, niizu datumina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu antu ami, tiyenu kudami. Enu akwamuza wami, tiyililenu kudami. Muloŋa lushimbi lwakafuma kudami, nakabalumuna wuŋa aji wami wakekaliwachejeji chanyuza yawantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuloŋa kwami kudi kwakwihi, wamwinuwami wunediki dehi, makasami akasompesha nyuza yawantu. Yitutu yakachiŋilila, yakakuhwelela chikasa chami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fumbulenu mesu enumumawulu, talenu nimaseki adi mwishina; muloŋa mawulu akaŋamu ka neyiwishi, niiseki dakakula neyi ihina dakuvwala, dielii chakafwawu niantu ashakamamu. Ilaŋa wamwinu wami wakekala wahaya nyaka, nikuloŋa kwamihikwamba kajiyaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mweluka kuloŋa, enu antu mukweti nshimbi jami munyichimayenu, ntiyililenu. Bayi mwakama kuyisawula kudi antuku, bayi muhayamakuyituka kudi wenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tububu twakayidya neyi ihina dakuvwala, mavunu akayidya neyi chadyaloŋa awu wanda; ilaŋa kuloŋa kwami saŋa akwekalila haya nyaka, niwamwinu wami wakashika kumakiŋu ejima, mufwawa muhiŋawa, mufwawa muhiŋa awa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi chikasa chaYehova tonaku, tonaku wuvwali Ŋovu; tonaku neyichadiŋa hamafuku akunyaka hamakiŋu akushankulu. Wamuketwili Rahabingwa ngwa, hiyeyuku? Wamupwikili chanzaŋombi, hiyeyuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wómishili kaluŋalwiji meji amwinyiŋi deneni, hiyeyuku? Welili hadiŋi meji amukaluŋalwiji hihadi njila yakuzambukila, hiyeyuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu aYehova akúulewa amba kafunta, akenza kuZiyona iku adi nakwimba tumina twawu, hanyitu yawu hakekala kuluŋa kwahaya nyaka. Akamona kuwaha nikuluŋa, yihuŋu nikudishishimona yakatemuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami, chalala yami, nayikundejaŋa; indi eyi yeyinyi? eyi watiyaloŋawoma muntu wakafwa, watiyaloŋa woma mwana kamuntu wakabalumukaneyi matahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunavulameni dehi kweyi Yehova wakutuŋili, watanjikili mawulu, waalili chikuku cheseki; mwaana wejima watiyaloŋa kwawomawa nsaŋu yakulendumuka kwakalendu mukaŋayi mukwakukabisha akwawu, hakudiloŋeshayi nindi enzi nakujilumuna akwawu. Indi kulendu mukakwalendu mukaŋayi mukwakukabisha akwawu kudi kudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkoli wakinjikewa akamusubula swayi; hakafwaku, hakaya mwikelaku, hela kudyakwindi hikwakabulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yami Yehova Nzambi yeyi nasaŋu munaŋa kaluŋalwiji mwaka mankanda indi avumaŋa. Ijina dindi diyi Yehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nashi mazu ami mukanwa keyi, nakubuti muwulelu wachikasachami, kulonda nitumbi mawulu, naali yikuku yeseki, nimwili Ziyona nami, Enu yenu antu ami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yerusalema wunanwi lupasa lwakulendumuka kwʼindi kuchikasa chaYehova, tonaku, tonaku, imanaku. Wunanwi dehi muiupasa lwachitasu, lwaletesha kutedaŋila, wunamanishumu to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana amayala anavwaliyi ejima hikudi wakulombola mama yawuku; anyana amayala ejima analeliyi hikudi wakukwata mama yawu kuchikasaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya yuma yiye diyi nakuwani, akukudila kudinyi? Kujilumuka, nikukisika, ninzala, nimpokuyakabali; nukukukundeja pahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyaneyi amayala anahwidili, adinaku kamojoka kunsa janyikwakwa, neyi kanyama nafwi muwanda. Anenzali kulendumuka kwaYehova, kuhoshola kwaNzambi yeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wamona ihuŋu, eyi washeta chakadi walwa, tiyaku dinu chumichi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
